      <activity id="c1f10b6c-7079-5f3c-97eb-c8eedba50c06" activityNameId="196383b3-9b96-524d-a7e4-81f89df88dc0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hydrogen peroxide, 50% in H2O, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hydrogen peroxide, 50% in H2O, at plant
data based on a study, performed by EMPA and Boustead Consulting, commissioned by CEFIC;
CAS number: 007722-84-1; 
Formula: H2O2; 
Synonyms: dihydrogen dioxide, Hydroperoxide, Hioxy, Oxydol, Peroxan, peroxide; 
UUID: f5f00599-78e8-3e05-911d-b79929630c6c
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of hydrogen peroxide by the anthrachinone process. Transport and infrastructure have been estimated. The input of 215 g air is not reported in the data according to the methodology of the study.
Location: average data from 8 European producers
Technology: average technology used from these European producers
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f5f00599-78e8-3e05-911d-b79929630c6c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
